[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD012
TITLE: Audit trace contains the requirement UID
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall issue a landing and refuse an unsafe line-up, then read the audit. The landing record shall contain SRS011 and the refusal shall contain SRS013, along with the aircraft identity and the decision. Acceptance is both records present and no issued record for the refused line-up.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The audit is the product-side link from a decision back to the requirement.
<<<
DAL: C
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: Audit records are operational, not debug prints.
RELATIONS:
